WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.560
 I have a automation that grab GitHub issue every four hours between 10 PM and

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:09.120
 6 AM so I can monitor it in the morning.

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:14.920
 And it also take features to implement that is already on the GitHub

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:18.160
 board and with a special label on it.

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:21.200
 And it's working only when I'm not working myself.

